OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested over 1993 unsolved
OL,4,ATooze murders faces no further action
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man arrested in connection with one
OL,7,Fof Wales' most notorious unsolved
OL,8,Fmurders is no longer under
OL,9,Finvestigation, police have said.
OL,11,FHarry and Megan Tooze were shot dead
OL,12,Fand found in a cow shed at their farm
OL,13,Fin Llanharry, Rhondda Cynon Taf, on 26
OL,14,FJuly 1993.
OL,16,FLast year, South Wales Police arrested
OL,17,Fan 87-year-old man but he will now face
OL,18,Fno further action.
